240,000 for three years\\nEHA Physician Scientist Research Grant, which can provide up to €240,000 for three years\\nEach one of the three types of EHA Research Grant also has its own specific eligibility criteria. Please make sure you read the eligibility criteria for your grant type before you apply.\\nTopics-in-Focus Research Grants: If your research focuses on hemoglobinopathies, you will have a competitive advantage in the sele\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-740265f7f67c3ce2a194ca41\", \"title\": \"EHA Grants Hall of Fame - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Grants Hall of Fame - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 4100, \"end\": 4179, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 79}, {\"start\": 4420, \"end\": 4440, \"excerpt_start\": 80, \"excerpt_end\": 100}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"2026 winners\\n2025 winners\\n2024 winners\\n2023 winners\\nPrevious winners, 2012–2022\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"title\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 4142, \"end\": 5742, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 1600}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership.\\nWelcome to Borderless Hematology.\\nEHA is the leading force in hematology, bringing the community together to share knowledge, collaborate, connect, and grow.\\nTogether we accelerate progress through education, science, and innovation. Together we improve patient outcomes and progress towards cures—across Europe and beyond.\\nTogether, the future of hematology is within our reach.\\nJoin us with membership that works for you or learn more about our story.\\nEHA2027 Congress\\nEuropean affairs\\nEHA Campus\\nGrants\\nSpecialized Working Groups\\nWhat’s new?\\nGo to overview\\nTu